#: apps/core/templates/core/dashboard.html:9
msgid ""
"The director's dashboard (vehicles on the road, alerts, service due, "
"documents, stock, approvals waiting) is built on day 57. Pages in the menu "
"unlock on the day shown next to them."
msgstr "Панель директора (машины в пути, оповещения, ТО, документы, склад, ожидающие подтверждения) будет готова на 57-й день. Пункты меню открываются в день, указанный рядом с ними."

#: apps/core/templates/core/dashboard.html:17
msgid "System status"
msgstr "Состояние системы"

#: apps/core/templates/core/dashboard.html:18
msgid "Open health check (JSON)"
msgstr "Открыть проверку (JSON)"

#: apps/fleet/forms.py:9
msgid "Filled data template (.xlsx)"
msgstr "Заполненный шаблон (.xlsx)"

#: apps/fleet/forms.py:15
#, python-format
msgid "The file is larger than %(mb)s MB."
msgstr "Файл больше %(mb)s МБ."

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:7
#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/vehicle_list.html:7 apps/fleet/views.py:112
msgid "Import from Excel"
msgstr "Импорт из Excel"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:12
msgid "Name, phone or licence"
msgstr "Ф.И.О., телефон или права"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:19
msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Ф.И.О."

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:20
msgid "Telegram phone"
msgstr "Телефон в Telegram"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:21
msgid "Licence"
msgstr "Права"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:22
msgid "Licence valid until"
msgstr "Права действуют до"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:23
msgid "Main vehicle"
msgstr "Основная машина"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:24
msgid "Bot"
msgstr "Бот"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:36
msgid "Expired"
msgstr "Просрочены"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:38
#, python-format
msgid "Within %(warn_days)s days"
msgstr "В течение %(warn_days)s дней"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:44
msgid "Linked"
msgstr "Подключён"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:46
msgid "Not yet"
msgstr "Ещё нет"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:57
#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/shift_list.html:106
#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/vehicle_list.html:52
msgid "Nothing found."
msgstr "Ничего не найдено."

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/driver_list.html:57
msgid "No drivers yet. Import them from the company data template."
msgstr "Водителей пока нет. Импортируйте их из шаблона данных компании."

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/import.html:7
msgid "1. Upload the filled template"
msgstr "1. Загрузите заполненный шаблон"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/import.html:9
msgid ""
"Vehicles and drivers are read from the Vehicles and Drivers sheets. Nothing "
"is saved until you confirm. Rows are matched by plate and phone, so the same "
"file can be imported again."
msgstr "Автомобили и водители читаются с листов Vehicles и Drivers. Ничего не сохраняется, пока вы не подтвердите. Строки сопоставляются по госномеру и телефону, поэтому тот же файл можно импортировать повторно."

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/import.html:23
msgid "Check the file"
msgstr "Проверить файл"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/import.html:29
msgid "Blank template"
msgstr "Пустой шаблон"

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/import.html:30
msgid ""
"Headers in Uzbek and Russian, dropdowns for fixed choices, an example on row "
"2."
msgstr "Заголовки на узбекском и русском, выпадающие списки, пример во 2-й строке."

#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/import.html:32
msgid "Download template"
msgstr "Скачать шаблон"

